-- ── ref_force_abilities (respec) ────────────────────────────────────────

[P]The user may spend [FP] to add one automatic [SU] to all checks made by a number of engaged friendly targets to up his Presence before the end of his next turn. If the user used any [DA] to generate [FP], reduce each target''s Willpower by 1 (to a minimum of 1) until the end of the encounter.', NULL, 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP] to sense all living things within short range (including animals and sentient beings).

[P]The user may spend [FP] to sense the current emotional state of one living target with whom he is engaged.', 'SENSE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P]The user may spend [FP] to immobilize a target within short range until the end of the user''s next turn. If the user used any [DA] to generate [FP], the target also suffers 1 wound per [FP] spent on the check (ignoring soak).', NULL, 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P] The user may spend [FP] to gain vague hints of events to come in the next day of their own, personal future.', 'FORSEE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Heal (light side Force user only)[b]: Spend [FP] to heal a number of wounds equal to Intellect from an engaged living creature (including user).
[P][B]Harm[b]: Spend [FP] to inflict a number of wounds equal to Intellect (ignoring soak) on an engaged living target. The user gains 1 Conflict.', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Harm[b]: Inflict additional wounds equal to ranks in Medicine.', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Harm[b]: If the user used any [DA] to generate [FP], the user heals an amount of strain equal to the wounds he inflicted on one target.', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Harm[b]: The user may spend [FP] to heal wounds on an engaged living creature (including self) equal to wounds inflicted on target.[I][See Long Text][i]', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Harm[b]: Whem the user is making a [B]Harm power check[b], he may also roll an [B]opposed Medicine versus Resilience check[b] (if the check was not already opposed) as part of the pool. If he inflicts one or more wounds on the target and succeeds on the Medicine check, he may also inflict one Critical Injury on the target and may spend [AD][AD] to add +10 to the roll (he may spend [AD][AD] to increase the roll multiple times).', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P][B]Harm[b]: Once per session, when this power kills a target, the user may restore to life an engaged character who died this encounter. Both characters gain 7 Conflict.
[BR][I][See Long Text][i]', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Harm[b]: Spend [FP] to inflict 1 additional wound per ranks in Strength.', 'HEALHARM', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Special Rule ([LI]/[DA] use)[b]: When guiding and shaping thoughts, only [FP] generated from [DA] may be used to generate negative emotions such as rage, fear, and hatred. Only [FP] generated from[LI] may be used to generate positive emotions such as peace, tranquility, and friendliness. Other emotions such as confusion can be created from [FP] generated from either [LI] or [DA].

[P]The character may spend [FP] to stress the mind of one living target (engaged), inflicting 1 strain.', 'INFLUENCE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]Spend [FP] to make a target within short range unable to perceive one object or being (silhouette 1 or smaller) until the beginning of the user’s next turn.', 'MISDIRECT', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP] to move one object of silhouette 0 that is within short range up to their maximum range (default range is short).', 'MOVE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Protect:[b] Combine with an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) Discipline[b] check. Spend [FP][FP] to reduce damage from an energy-based weapon by an amount equal to Willpower characteristic plus 1 per [SU]. 
[P][B]Unleash:[b] As an attack action, combine with an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) Discipline[b] check. Range: Short, Base Damage equal to Willpower, Crit Rating: [AD][AD][AD][AD]. Gain 1 Conflict.', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Unleash[b]: Spend [AD] on the Discipline check to inflict 1 strain on the target (ignoring soak).', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Unleash[b]: Spend [FP] to have the attack gain the Ensnare 2 quality. The user may not activate this multiple times.', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Unleash[b]: Once per game session a Dark Side user may spend a Destiny Point to use Unleash as a maneuver.', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Unleash[b]: The user may spend [FP] to give the attack the Burn 2 quality.', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P][B]Unleash[b]: Dark Side Users may spend [FP] to reduce the attack''s critical rating to 1.

[P][B]Unleash[b]: This upgrades represents mastering the ultimate dark side technique, the dreaded Force lightning. If the user is a dark side Force user, he may spend [FP] to reduce the attack''s critical rating to 1.', 'PROTUNL', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP][FP] to gain insight into the general location or direction of a person or object that he knows about, regardless of current distance.

[P]Spend [FP] and make an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) Vigilance[b] check (or [B]opposed Vigilance versus Discipline[b] check) to see through illusions.', 'SEEK', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP] to gain hints about what an individual within short range is likely to do in the near future.', 'WARFOR', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P]May spend [FP] to add automatic [FA] made against the user or an ally within short range until the end of their next turn.', 'SUPPRESS', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P]May spend a [FP] to cause one vehicle or starship [they] are engaged with to recover one system strain [I](multiple activation allowed)[i].', 'MANIPULATE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[BR]The user may spend [FP] to ignore the effects of darkness or blindness and see normally at up to medium range for the remainder of the round (or for one minute).  This allows the user to view everything most sentients would normally be able to see on a well lit day.', 'FARSIGHT', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP][FP] to increase one of another engaged character''s characteristics by 1 (max of 6) until the end of the user''s next turn.

[P]This can only be used once per character per encounter.  If the user uses [DA] to generate [FP], the target increases a second characteristic by 1 (max of 6) until the end of the user''s next turn, but both user and target suffer 3 strain.', 'IMBUE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Ebb:[b] When making a skill check, combine an [B]Ebb power check[b] as part of the roll.    User may spend [FP] to suffer 1 strain, then inflict 1 strain on all other engaged characters[I](multiple activation not allowed)[i].

[P][B]Flow:[b] When making a skill check, combine a [B]Flow power check[b] as part of the roll.  User may spend [FP] to heal 1 strain[I](multiple activation not allowed)[i].


[P][B]Flow:[b] When the Force user makes a skill check, he may roll a [B]Flow power check[b] as part of the roll.  The user may spend [FP] to heal 1 strain.  The force user may not activate this multiple times.', 'EBBFLOW', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
[P][B]Flow:[b] When making a combined Flow power check, may spend [FP] to add [AD] to any checks using the same skill before the end of their next turn[I](multiple activation not allowed)[i].', 'EBBFLOW', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;


[P][B]Flow:[b] When making a combined Flow power check, the Force user may spend[FP] to add [SU] to any checks the Force user makes that use that same skill before the end of his next turn.  The Force user may not activate this multiple times.', 'EBBFLOW', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P][B]Flow:[b] Once per session, if the user healed at least 5 strain from this power add [TR] to user’s next check.', 'EBBFLOW', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;

[P]The user may spend [FP] to create a facsimile of a Brawl or Melee weapon with the following profile: (Brawl or Melee; Damage: +3; Critical 3; Range [Engaged]: Cortosis) anywhere within short range, it must remain within short range or it dissipates. At the end of the user''s next turn, this item dissipates. At the GM''s discretion, the user can instead conjure a simple tool and other useful low-tech item with an encumbrance no greater than 1.', 'CONJURE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO NOTHING;
